config COMP_RUST_TEMPLATE
	tristate "Rust template example component (llext)"
	default n
	depends on LLEXT
	help
	  Build a minimal SOF processing module whose entire module_interface
	  vtable is implemented in Rust via the sof_module crate. Selecting =m
	  builds it as a dynamically loadable llext for Xtensa targets.

	  Requires a Rust toolchain capable of cross-compiling to
	  xtensa-intel_ace30_ptl-zephyr-elf (see sof/doc/rust.md).
